### Rejestracja czujnika – 201 + Location; klucz zapisywany w {{apiKey}}, id w {{sensorId}}
POST {{host}}/api/sensors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Czujnik salon",
  "seriesId": {{seriesId}}
}

> {%
    client.global.set("apiKey", response.body.apiKey);
    client.global.set("sensorId", response.body.id);
%}

### Lista czujników (bez kluczy)
GET {{host}}/api/sensors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Odczyt czujnika (bez klucza)
GET {{host}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Rejestracja dla nieistniejącej serii – 422
POST {{host}}/api/sensors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Czujnik widmo",
  "seriesId": 999999999
}

### Lista czujników bez tokenu – 401
GET {{host}}/api/sensors
Accept: application/json

### Wyrejestrowanie czujnika – 204; potem jego klucz daje 401, wyniki zostają
DELETE {{host}}/api/sensors/{{sensorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Wynik kluczem wyrejestrowanego czujnika – 401
POST {{host}}/api/measurements
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 21.0
}

### Wynik z samym tokenem administratora – 401
POST {{host}}/api/measurements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "value": 21.0
}
